I have lost 20 lbs and my blood sugar numbers are much better. 

But now I can’t find Mounjaro anywhere. @Walgreens just advises to call around😡

@Big__TeeJ @datepsych I have a  6’6” high IQ professional friend who weighed 325 lbs, that in 2022 I recommended tirzepatide to.

He lost 110 lbs, now has a BMI of 21, and feels great.

Why haven’t you availed yourself of a GLP-1, are you too smart for that?

